flowchart TB
  UI[Next.js Dashboard] -->|HTTPS REST| API[FastAPI · one process]
  API --> W[DataSentinel Workflow]
  W --> P[Pipeline Engine<br/>Data Generator · Pipeline Runner · Incident Injector]
  W --> D[Detection Engine<br/>Data Profiler · Drift Rules · Severity]
  W --> I[Investigation Engine<br/>Evidence Builder · Git Analyzer · RCA]
  P --> R[Remediation Engine · propose patch]
  D --> R
  I --> R
  R --> H{Human approval}
  H -->|Apply + commit| V[Validation Engine · rerun + profile + tests]
  V -->|All checks pass| REPORT[Reporter · RESOLVED]
  REPO[(workspace/pipeline_repo<br/>Real monitored Git repository<br/>Regression · Fix · Rollback commits)] <--> I
  REPO --> P
  H -->|Approved apply| REPO
  W --> DISK[(Persistent filesystem<br/>JSON state · data · artifacts)]
  I --> HEUR[Heuristic RCA · source of truth]
  I -->|EvidencePackage only| LLM[Optional Anthropic / OpenAI]
  LLM --> G[Grounding layer · bounded explanations]
  HEUR --> G
  G --> R
  V -->|VALIDATION_FAILED| RB{Operator rollback}
  RB --> REST[Restore pre-fix source + commit]
  REST --> REPO
  REST -->|Retryable · ROOT_CAUSE_IDENTIFIED| R
